WEBVTT

00:25:54.913 --> 00:26:00.704
I hope I'm able to incorporate from a
values perspective and all of my work

00:26:00.704 --> 00:26:02.579
and the arts that I contribute to.

00:26:04.496 --> 00:26:05.954
I don't know if that answers
your question,

00:26:05.954 --> 00:26:09.496
but it's something that I been
greatly on my mind of late.

00:26:09.954 --> 00:26:13.454
And a related question right now,
in this point in your life,

00:26:13.704 --> 00:26:16.621
what is something that you're trying
to be a better human at?

00:26:17.538 --> 00:26:19.371
I'm trying to have more
patience with people.

00:26:20.663 --> 00:26:24.954
I'm trying to be better at recognizing
that the world is on fire,

00:26:25.163 --> 00:26:28.538
figuratively and literally, and that
everybody is going through a lot.

00:26:29.246 --> 00:26:35.454
And that moment when I feel the
need to judge or they feel